# ── Tableau ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tableau's "My Tableau Repository" was created inside this project folder.
# These are Tableau's own defaults (Sample - Superstore, World Indicators,
# shape palettes, logs) — not project files. The workbook itself,
# "Analysis UK.twb", is tracked and lives in the repo root.
#
# To stop Tableau writing here: File > Repository Location, point it at
# Documents/My Tableau Repository.
Bookmarks/
Connectors/
Datasources/
Extensions/
Logs/
Mapsources/
OAuthConfigs/
Services/
Shapes/
Workbooks/
Preferences.tps
*.twb.bak

